    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Grimm's Folly</i> is a 15+ hour,\u00a0 first-person adventure puzzle game with a unique twist\u2014you don\u2019t just control the main character, but also a raven companion. Use the raven to explore unreachable areas, collect hidden items, and even soar through time trial challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange electrical wires snake across a desolate landscape, leading you through the remains of a 1990s nuclear research facility\u2014now trapped within an inescapable sphere. With no clear way out, your only hope lies in solving intricate puzzles, uncovering the truth, and finding a way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: The voices were generated with Murf's TTS service.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Thanks to the wonderful Steam community, the voices are slowly being converted to voice actors, which will be added as soon as they are completed.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Grimm's Folly</i> is a 15+ hour,\u00a0 first-person adventure puzzle game with a unique twist\u2014you don\u2019t just control the main character, but also a raven companion. Use the raven to explore unreachable areas, collect hidden items, and even soar through time trial challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange electrical wires snake across a desolate landscape, leading you through the remains of a 1990s nuclear research facility\u2014now trapped within an inescapable sphere. With no clear way out, your only hope lies in solving intricate puzzles, uncovering the truth, and finding a way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: The voices were generated with Murf's TTS service.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Thanks to the wonderful Steam community, the voices are slowly being converted to voice actors, which will be added as soon as they are completed.</p>",
    "short_description": "In Grimm\u2019s Folly, find yourself falling through a wormhole and landing in a trash heap. The world around you, dark and unfamiliar, is not your own. Someone has trapped you here. And that someone doesn\u2019t ever want you to leave.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
